@startuml
title Search Flow

actor User
participant "React SPA" as SPA
participant "API Gateway" as APIGW
participant "api_search" as SEARCH
database "OpenSearch" as OS

User -> SPA : Enter search query
SPA -> APIGW : GET /search?q=...
APIGW -> SEARCH : Proxy request
SEARCH -> SEARCH : Build query and pagination options
SEARCH -> OS : POST index/_search
OS --> SEARCH : Matching documents
SEARCH --> APIGW : Search response DTO
APIGW --> SPA : 200 OK

@enduml